  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/paleont/startYear">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">start year</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/paleont/CalibratedInterval"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">xsd:integer, NOT xsd:gYear. Two reasons. (1) xsd:gYear is
        not part of the OWL 2 datatype map, so HermiT refuses to load an
        ontology that uses it — the reasoner step fails before it starts.
        (2) integers compare arithmetically, which CQ4b needs, and negative
        values express BCE without special handling.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
